<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. above financial results of Company have been reviewed by Audit Committee and approved by Board of Directors of the Company in their respective meetings held on 19.07.2021. financial results are prepared in accordance with Indian Accounting Standards (“Ind AS”), as applicable and guidelines issued by Securities and Exchange Board of India (“SEBI”). Ind AS are prescribed under section 133 of the Act read with Rule 3 of Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules, 2015, and Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) (Amendment) Rules, 2016.      2. Company has made an assessment of recoverability of the Company’s assets such as Trade receivables, unbilled revenue, and Inventories, specifically considering the ongoing COVID-19 pandemic, the Company has considered internal and external information up to the date of approval of these standalone financial results. Based on the current indicators of future economic conditions, the Company expects to recover the carrying amount of these assets.impact of COVID-19 remains uncertain and may be different from what we have estimated as of date of approval of these standalone financial results and Company will continue to closely monitor any material changes to future economic conditions.      3. Company is primarily engaged in one business segment viz. construction/project activities, as determined by chief decision maker in accordance with Ind AS 108, Operating Segments.      4. Code on Social Security, 2020 ('Code') has been notified in  Official Gazette of India on September 29, 2020, which could impact the contributions of the Company towards certain employment benefits. effective date from which changes are applicable is yet to be notified and the rules are yet to be framed. Impact, if any, of change will be assessed and accounted in the period of notification of relevant provisions.      5. The figures for the quarter ended 31.03.2021 are balancing figures between audited figures in respect of full financial year up 31.03.2021 and unaudited published year-to-date figures up to 31.12.2020, being the date of end of the third quarter of financial year which were subjected to limited review.      6. Previous period figures have been regrouped/rearranged, wherever necessary, to correspond to current period’s presentation.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
